###1.	I have done these with GraphPad, but I think Mina has used R. So she probably can help you more, if you need help. I performed the analysis by placing the progression free months on the X axis and grouping the samples on the Y axis into two categories based on expression levels: low expression and high expression. Instead of using the expression values, put the Progression values (0 or 1) there instead.

